{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>What is this?</b> Because he sees that a foreigner, an uncircumcised resident, and a hired worker may not eat of it — unlike on other festivals. Another interpretation: <b>What is this?</b> Concerning Pesah and Matzah we have already heard the reason, but concerning the redemption of the firstborn son and the animal we have not heard. And you shall say to him: כי בחזק יד etc. — therefore, since He saved our firstborns and the firstborn of our animals, I slaughter etc."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:57:36.284898223Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}